@startuml proximity-detection
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Proximity Detection: User đứng giữa 2 gian hàng

actor User
participant "Map page\n(component)" as Comp
participant "useProximity\nDetection" as Hook
participant "Geolocation API\n(browser)" as GPS
participant "/map/pins API" as API
participant "haversine\nMeters()" as Calc
participant "GpsAutoPlay\nController" as Auto
participant "useAutoPlay" as Play

== 1. Mount: load danh sách pin ==

Comp -> Hook : useProximityDetection(position)
Hook -> API : getPublicPins() — chỉ gọi 1 lần
API --> Hook : { pins[], boundary }
Hook -> Hook : setPins(data.pins)

== 2. Mỗi lần GPS có toạ độ mới ==

GPS --> Comp : watchPosition → coords
Comp -> Hook : truyền position prop

note right of Hook
  debounce 500ms
  (tránh re-render khi GPS jitter)
end note

loop với mỗi pin
    Hook -> Calc : haversineMeters(userLat, userLng, pinLat, pinLng)
    Calc --> Hook : distance (m)
end

Hook -> Hook : filter distance ≤ 4m\nsort tăng dần
Hook --> Comp : nearbyStores = [{ storeId, distanceMeters }]

== 3. Logic khi User đứng giữa 2 store (mỗi store cách 3m) ==

note over User
  GH1 ← 3m ── User ── 3m → GH2
end note

Comp -> Auto : nearbyStores = [GH1, GH2]
Auto -> Auto : find(s => !session.get(s))\n→ GH1 chưa phát → chọn GH1
Auto -> Play : tryPlay(GH1)
Play --> User : 🔊 phát thuyết minh GH1
Auto -> Auto : session.set(GH1, true)

... User vẫn đứng yên, GH1 đã phát xong ...

Comp -> Auto : nearbyStores = [GH1, GH2]
Auto -> Auto : GH1 đã phát → bỏ qua\nGH2 chưa phát → chọn GH2
Auto -> Play : tryPlay(GH2)
Play --> User : 🔊 phát thuyết minh GH2
Auto -> Auto : session.set(GH2, true)

@enduml
